{"data":{"body":"[P1] Match the configured filesystem path\n\nThe generated function sets `FILESYSTEM_SERDES_PATH` to `/mnt/efs`, and the stage writes payloads directly beneath that path. Consequently every envelope contains `/mnt/efs/<name>.payload`, so this assertion deterministically fails the newly enabled E2E job. Assert `/mnt/efs/`, or provision and configure the `durable-payloads` subdirectory consistently.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ocgQc","finding_digest":"6e12f5cc8bb0c8f535736d258db8323556cbe9020bd8b39d28338f7a8f953f7a","finding_id":"arf_v1_nyjpltelwdepknltnusy3obsgv","finding_key":"examples-cloud-integration::assert-filesystem-envelope::mounted-base-path","identity_key":"examples-cloud-integration::assert-filesystem-envelope::mounted-base-path","line":911,"observation_digest":"f7f482446703beb49d3fa61d1a131d81e480d3d1cc706dedbe4970225cdc9680","observation_id":"aro_v1_672ierdhao7ljhj7uyoruey5qh","path":"examples/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/examples/CloudBasedIntegrationTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T00:57:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f4j3wxl4w7tjcxk3ncd67glqoe","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"bd098098c29efddab8c781e68c7500bf030b1190","reviewer":"codex","start_line":911,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_mor26fjsfxd6q2uy2p3lunlgy3"},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_ii7otmmfojyvttdgctosibdij6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T00:57:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
